  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Originally built-in to plug-and-play clone consoles, this is a Chinese-issued multicart featuring an eclectic assortment of pirate originals (Abscondee, Mouse Hero, Escapeway, etc), typical bootlegged multicart titles (Donkey Kong, Mario Brothers, Seicross, Road Fighter, Millipede, etc), and not one but six (SIX!) different Contra multicarts. Yes, it's a multicart with multicarts - break out your old Xzibit Yo Dawg memes and start playing!"
    }
